SIZE 35 mm, 25 mm
GAP 3 mm, 0 mm
DIRECTION 0,0
REFERENCE 0,0
OFFSET 0 mm
SET PEEL OFF
SET CUTTER OFF
SET PARTIAL_CUTTER OFF
SET TEAR ON
CLS
CODEPAGE 1252
; Body is generated by _print_marker_label so each line can be centred:
; TSPL alignment is not supported across all TSC firmware, so the x of
; every line is computed from the text length instead.
@body@
PRINT 1,1
